// Number of logical CPUs, a compiler-emitted prelude wrapper.
//
// `sysconf(_SC_NPROCESSORS_ONLN)` (POSIX) and `GetSystemInfo` (Windows)
// aren't a single portable libc call, so like `std.c.atomic`, the real
// implementation is a small wrapper the compiler writes into every
// program's prelude; this just describes that wrapper's signature. Always
// at least 1.
pub fun __fun_cpu_count() num;
